ootage of Marvel's  spider-man far from home has already  known spider-man leaves New York City  behind for a city tour the new posters  shows snapshots of spider-man in Berlin  in front of the Brandenburg Gate in  Venice in front of the ponte rialto and  in london on top of the London Eye and  just three months after Avengers end  games by the man far from home we'll  continue with the next chapter of the  Marvel superhero saga spider-man has not  only on a European tour to see the  beautiful cities but has his hands full  dealing with the elementary creatures  earth fire and water  how exactly spider-man far from home  will turn out can be seen in the cinemas  on 5th of July 2009 T on Monday evening  Apple introduced its new streaming  service Apple TV plus the new rebel  product to Amazon Prime Netflix &amp; Co  will be launched in autumn why Apple now  also wants to open up the market for  streaming providers is obvious after all  the sales figures for iPhones have been  failing for quite some time and as a  global company you have to open up new  markets in order to remain relevant this  will also include an own credit card and  a payment platform for video games if  you believe the New York Times there are  currently about two dozen in-house  productions in the making which will go  online and fall the competition is  definitely tough as amazon prime and  netflix together currently dominate most  of the market nevertheless it will be  interesting to see how Apple will  present itself with Apple TV Plus in the  fall after all according to current  information there will be a series by  Steven Spielberg and live talk shows by  Oprah Winfrey Hollywood star Angelina  Jolie could become a marble heroine in  the near future in the Eternals the  story is about godlike beings which are  in an intergalactic war according to  Marvel boss Kevin Feige the complete  plot of the film could cover tens of  thousands of years which role Jolie will  play exactly isn't known yet but the  commitment to the Eternals would be her  superhero debut the shooting is  scheduled for this summer and the  release date is even planned for the end  of 2020  after a successful Halloween reboot  horror producer Jason Blum will now take  on the next horror classic Andrew  Fleming's the Kraft  loom simply keeps an eye on how to  reboot decades-old horror movies for  little money to make groundbreaking  bucks of his profits take Halloween for  example which had production cost of  just 10 million u.s. dollars and brought  in two hundred and fifty three million  u.s. dollars worldwide and like this it  is supposed to happen with the craft and  best case originally planned was a  sequel to the 1969 original film in  which a new group of women practice Isis  dark magic it is unclear at the Blum who  has recently secured the rights of the  movie  also go along the path of the secret or  rather the path of the reboot in  Halloween it was also a sequel which  worked really well so what is the craft  all about in a nutshell it's about a  group of four young girls who realize  that they can use dark magic to  influence things in their favor however  as it is so often the case playing  around with dark magic isn't without  consequences at all it's not yet known  when the craft will be released yet we  can hope that blue mouse will soon  realize the project  [Music]
 

